window.products.push({"id":219012,"name":"Quicklock RTA (Ready-to-Assemble) Wall Kitchen Cabinets - Shaker Style 100% Hardwood Soft Close Hardware Storage Cabinet Home Improvement… (12\" D x 30","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TAiZVjBbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quicklock cabinets is a direct manufacturer of RTA kitchen cabinets for your home improvement project. Since we source all our lumber, manufacture, package, and warehouse locally, we can guarantee your kitchen cabinets will arrive on time. We pride ourselves on innovative, easy to assemble, made in America cabinets! Quicklock shaker wall cabinets offer the customer a modern kitchen design and elegant finish that will suit your style. Our painted cabinet line is available in Pure white, Magnetic Grey as well as Provincial Stain. Our Raw Maple wall cabinet is beautiful as they come but also a blank canvas for creativity to customize your own style and look. Our Rustic Hickory shaker wall cabinets round out our cabinet line with a warm cozy cabin feel. All Quicklock shaker wall cabinets are made with 100% maple hardwood and include soft close cabinet door hinges pre-installed giving them a smooth finish touch. The box construction is 3/8” birch plywood making it durable enough for all your kitchen storage needs. Whether you are doing a full kitchen remodel, bathroom remodel, or simply adding garage cabinets for extra storage, our ready-to-assemble cabinets offer the perfect solution for any project. Laundry room cabinets are also a necessity for that extra storage space you have always needed. Our shaker cabinets will bring modern feel to any home. So, now’s the time to build the kitchen of your dreams. Quicklock shaker wall cabinets will inspire your kitchen ideas especially for the DIYer who loves the hands-on approach. We make it super easy with a full color, step-by-step assembly guide included. The Quicklock wall cabinet assembles in just a few minutes with only 4 screws and wood glue. Due to the natural grain of hardwood maple, the cabinet may very slightly in color from the images. -Made in America -Amish Crafted -5-year craftsmanship warranty -Soft-close hardware -100% Hardwood -Quick and easy assembly in minutes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TAiZVjBbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09N9XH99S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N9XH99S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N9XH99S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
