window.products.push({"id":219086,"name":"LiquiBev 9 Piece Tumbler Ultimate Beverage Set, 30 oz.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qHDtubWwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sip longer with the Liquibev, a high-quality, reusable, insulated steel tumbler that stands out from the competition. Staying hydrated on the go is tricky. Plastic water bottles expose you to chemicals like BPA, while disposable drinks clutter up our landfills. Grab the Liquibev to enjoy your favorite beverages while out and about. Not only does the tight fitting lid prevent spills or drips as you're moving and shaking, the advanced TempLock system provides the longest possible temperature control on the market. If you mix up a cold smoothie with ice, you'll still be able to enjoy a cool sip 24 hours later. Coffee, tea and other hot beverages remain pleasantly warm and flavorful for up to 10 hours. The Liquibev goes beyond the basics with 18/8 stainless steel construction. The numbers refer to the chromium content, the metal that is essential for preventing rust and corrosion. Forgetting to empty out your tumbler for a few days won't result in a damaged cup. The all metal tumbler construction ensures there's no flavors or odors to ruin your enjoyment of a tasty drink, while the two included lids are made from BPA-free plastic to preserve your health. Don't forget about the accessories. Slip on the optional but included handle to get a better grip when the walls are a little toasty from a hot drink. Choose between straight and bent straws based on your preferences--four are included, with two of each type, so you can clean one while using the other. There's even a straw cleaning brush to make sure there's nothing hiding inside the tube. Many people become frustrated with other types of tumblers after a few messy mishaps. We've engineered the Liquibev specifically to prevent these kinds of problems. Swap the open-mouth lid for the SplashGuard design to make sure not a drop ends up on your favorite outfit or the new car's upholstery. The same double walled insulated design that keeps your drinks hot or cold also prevents condensation. There's no drips or sweat to l","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qHDtubWwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LiquiBev","source_asin":"B01N0R8MRJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219086","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N0R8MRJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N0R8MRJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
