window.products.push({"id":219138,"name":"L'HOPAN Easy Grips Salt and Pepper Grinder Set - Adjustable Coarseness Stainless Steel Pepper Grinder Mill Thickened Glass Body(2 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lStduAJDL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE STYLE: The brushed stainless steel grinder with high-quality glass body combines two into one, preserve any two kinds of spices in this container and save the money and space for another grinder. This modern and classy pepper mill with two stylish stainless-steel finishes will be a great addition to any kitchen. The appearance looks concise and fashionable. Perfect for meal or dinner party. MANUAL ADJUSTABLE GRINDER : This high-quality pepper mill equipped with a unique grinding mechanism. You can spin the rotor of this Salt and Pepper grinder to adjust the granular size. Then twist the grinder at the top of the shaker to have your favorite coarseness of spice. Adjustable from a fine to coarse grind. EASILY REFILLED: The glass body highlights the level of your spice and is easy to refill, unscrew grinder top and refill with your pepper, salt, spice. KEEP FRESHNESS – The sealed stainless steel cap on both ends keeps your favorite spices fresh and away from moisture for a long time. MAINTENANCE: Rinse before first use. Hand wash recommended. Please gently clean and use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lStduAJDL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"L'HOPAN","source_asin":"B07RJ2JX6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RJ2JX6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RJ2JX6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":219139,"name":"Creative Mark Plein Air Wooden Picture Frame - 24X36 Black - 1 Pack of Poster Frame for Art Panels, Stretched Canvas, Pictures and More","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qUpm5jX3L._AC_SL1152_.jpg","description":"Five Elegant Frames With Timeless Style! Our most popular ready-made frame style, Plein Aire frames are beloved by artists and framers the world over! The 3\" wide molding is enhanced by a raised and rounded top edge and offset inner groove. The 1/2\" deep rabbet frame depth allows for framing flat artworks behind glass, or even 3/4\" deep canvases with the use of offset clips (sold separately). Plein Aire frames have a solid wood composition coated in gesso to ensure a smooth, blemish-free surface, and the 5 finish choices are sure to fit with any artwork! The hardware required to hang this poster frame is included. Whether you're looking for a classic frame style for your traditional paintings or your modern prints, Plein Aire frames are sure to suit your fancy! These picture frames are available in all the common sizes, and are ideal for paintings, photos, and prints; hanging your own artwork; adding prestige to any piece of art; and more. Easy-to-use. These frames are available in 5 Classic Finishes - Black, White, Gold Leaf, Silver Leaf, and Mahagony.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qUpm5jX3L._AC_SL1152_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Mark","source_asin":"B08MB5P9ND","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MB5P9ND","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MB5P9ND","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
