window.products.push({"id":219148,"name":"DILATATA 2 Pack 6 ft/Pieces Velvet Fall Leaves Fall Garland for Mantle Maple Leaf Garland Fall Decor for Home Dinner Party Hanging Fall Leaves Garland","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HJDgllWPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE CRAFTSMANSHIP AND MATERIALS: we use of velvet fabric combined with high temperature setting process makes the leaves texture clear and realistic, and soft-touch feeling. Silver thread and velvet fabric are intertwined to make the leaves sparkle without falling off like glitter. Even if it is squeezed, autumn vine garland can restore its shape without deformation. 5 CLASSICAL RICH COLOR: The artificial maple leaves decor range from dark green to vibrant orange,red.The autumn maple leaves with 5 classical colors from light to dark are mixed together, which makes fall leaves garland look vivid and full of festival atmosphere. Autumn garland looks like the real fallen leaves, making for a great blend of colors to warm up any room. Porch garland fall perfect festival decorations for indoor or outdoor. RECYCLABLE ARTIFICIAL GARLAND: Fall vine garland last for years, and there are all kinds of classic designs that will never go out of style.Our fall decor can be used over and over again. You can fold fall autumn garland if you think the artificial autumn foliage garland occupies too much space, which can save your space. SIZE: Length: 6 feet/piece, packing include 2 pieces of artificial maple leaves garlands, total length: 12 feet. 68 pcs maple leaves.One order comes with 2 strands of fall leaves garland and 4 hooks.Versatile- Whether you only need 6 feet for the mantel, 12 feet draping over a door frame, or 24 feet for the stair banisters, this autumn leaf garland has you covered. Just use multiple fall garlands together to create the length you need. VERSATILE AUTUMN DECOR FOR HOME：Artificial fall foliage garland is perfect for Indoor, Outdoor, Autumn, Wedding, Door,Fireplace, Thanksgiving, Festival, and Dinner Party, as a kind of fall hanging vines plants, fall vines decor can also decorate balcony, walls, fireplaces, yard, tables, door frames, stairs, windows, or any places lack of artificial garlands.The fall swags and garlands is perfect festival decorations for indoor or outdoor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HJDgllWPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DILATATA","source_asin":"B0B9BYB1GG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9BYB1GG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9BYB1GG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
