window.products.push({"id":219298,"name":"Alaskan Ulu, Inupiat Style with Polar Bear Etched Handle, 6\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rrDPs7XWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Ulu is a knife with a semi-circular blade originally crafted by the native Alaskan people over three thousand years ago. Styled for utility, this design comes from the Inupiat indians of North Western Alaska. The blade (world-class stainless steel with a single beveled edge) measures 6 inches and has a four inch Golden Alaskan Birchwood handle. The knife comes with a convenient Birch storage stand as well. The Ulu performs cutting and chopping jobs with the greatest of ease. Because the center of force is concentrated directly over the middle of the blade, it creates twice the direct downward force compared to that of conventional cutlery where the force is behind the center of the blade. Anyone, including those with hand or wrist problems, can perform cutting, chopping and mincing tasks effortlessly, as a result of this dynamic feature. This makes the Ulu excelllent for cutting all sorts of meats, herbs, vegetables, cheeses, and even pizza. These larger handle ULUs with the open blade are very popular with the avid Ulu user. Works very well with the Ulu Block & Bowl cutting block.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rrDPs7XWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The ULU Factory","source_asin":"B00020H26I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219298","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00020H26I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00020H26I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":219299,"name":"Whirlpool Commercial Water Cooler, Storage Cabinet, Digital Temperature Display, Ice Chilled Water, Steaming Hot, Stainless Steel Water Dispenser","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mX7XJufJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This commercial water cooler is a one stop drink station, as it provides storage in the bottom for all your favorite teas, instant coffee and soups. The digital display lets you know when you have the perfect temperature for making your hot or cold beverages. Gorgeous curved stainless steel front looks amazing in the kitchen or office. This commercial grade version features reliably very cold and very hot water, and is built to endure many years of heavy use. The most important feature of a water cooler is how well it cools, as many brands struggle to maintain 50°F, which is not cold enough. Whirlpool water coolers use a different type of cooling technology that forms ice inside the water tank, delivering refreshingly cold 40°F when you need it most, like during a summer heat wave. Likewise the hot water uses patented technology to maintain water at a steaming temperature, which guarantees a well brewed cup of tea. The commercial grade engineering features a compressor and thermostat that outlasts others by cycling a fraction of the time others do. The sturdy solid steel frame is built to take hundreds of pounds of top pressure. The faucets are engineered to be unbreakable with normal use, unlike many others that break off easily. The hot button is toddler resistant. Comes with an Resource SaverTM switch in the back that allows the hot water to be turned off when not in use. Compatible with both 5 and 3 gallon bottles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mX7XJufJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whirlpool","source_asin":"B019J6U9I8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219299","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019J6U9I8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019J6U9I8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
