window.products.push({"id":219361,"name":"AIMILAR Digital Countdown Days Timer - 9999 Days Count Down Days Timer with Backlight for Retirement Wedding Vacation Christmas New Baby Classroom Lab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qCL8KqEsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Digital Countdown Days Timer - 9999 Days Count Down Days Timer With Backlight for Retirement Wedding Vacation Christmas New Baby Classroom Kitchen Cooking Product Features: 1. Long Setting Countdown Time: Up to 9999 Days  2. Calculate the Countdown Time Automatically.  3. With Backlight. Press any button to start the backlight.  4. Memory Function  1). Hold the \"Clear\" button until you see all the numbers shows \"0\".  2). Push the \"Enter\" button,it will counting down from your last setting. 5.Big LCD Screen and Easy to Read  6.You can view the tartget date by pressing \"look\" button during countdown. 7.Play Your Imagination! You can design the card by yourself. How to set the countdown time? Step 1: Press the \"Finish\" button to set the target/ending time. Step 2: Press the \"Current\" button to set the current/starting time. Step 3: Press the \"Enter\" button, timer will work automatically. Specification： Screen Size: 65 * 35mm / 2.5 * 1.4 in. Product Dimension: 129(L) * 64(H)mm / 5(L) * 2.5(H) in. Net Weight: 144g / 5.08oz. Battery Required：2 * AAA batteries (NOT Included). Troubleshooting Tips: 1.Buttons don't work. This occurs while countdown is working, you need reset the clock by holding the \"Clear\" button for around 5 seconds, then buttons will work. 2.Screen is stuck and display \"Err\". This means that your starting and finish(ending) time was set incorrectly. Make sure the finish(ending) time is after the starting time. 3. Countdown result is calculated inaccurately. Just set your finish/target time first, then set the current/starting time and press \"Enter\" button immediately. SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: 30-Day money back and 2-Year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qCL8KqEsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIMILAR","source_asin":"B07GPNWG19","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GPNWG19","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GPNWG19","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
