window.products.push({"id":219383,"name":"Avryware Stainless Steel Refillable Spice Grinder Mill For Salt, Pepper, and Seasoning - Thumb Operated Push Button For One Hand Grinding","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21xDAnsbeqL._AC_.jpg","description":"Let the seasoning begin with the finest salt, pepper & spice grinder mill! Are you fed up with old fashioned shakers and you want to upgrade your cooking style? Do you need a powerful grinder that is both manual, but comfortable in use? If the answer to those questions is yes, then you should keep on reading because we proudly present you, the most compact sleek salt and pepper mill for all of your cooking experiments! Add flavor & taste to any food with the touch of a button. The ergonomic slim design of our grinder will allow you to add flavor and freshly ground spices or herbs on your food without sprinkling grinds all over the floor or kitchen table. Just push the button with your thumb and get instant seasoning and rich aroma on any food of your preference. Ideal for BBQ Sundays, traveling with your RV or beach excursions! Trust us, it has never been that easy and mess free to grind your own sea salt or peppercorn. Stainless steel mill shaker with durable metal grinder rod for optimal performance. Our wonderfully constructed stainless steel grinder won't rust or corrode. The built in metal grinding rod will crush, mill and grind all of your spices with ease without even breaking a sweat. This handy kitchen tool will satisfy even the most demanding grinding needs, unlike the other grinders with ceramic rods that bend or break during grinding. Such a thoughtful housewarming gift to a friend or a family member! With our affordable prices, you can get a few extra ones and fill them with coriander, mustard and sesame seeds, allspice or even anise! Start a collection of spices and grinders right away.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21xDAnsbeqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Avryware","source_asin":"B01KL0BWUK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KL0BWUK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KL0BWUK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
