window.products.push({"id":219456,"name":"Lureu Rustic Yellow Sunflower in Vase Farmhouse Cottage Countryside 12\"x12\" Canvas Wall Art Prints,Framed Picture Photo Painting Giclee Artwork,Modern","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ot4mAhuPL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Our Parcel Will Include Rustic Yellow Sunflower In Vase Farmhouse Cottage Countryside Wall Decor Picture Art Print,a Pair Of White Glove,a Gradienter Level And Screws All Well-packed.Wall Art Is A Must-have,giving Your Room A True Focal Point, Wall Art Is Always A Great Way To Spruce Up Your Space. Our Amazing Artwork Will Certainly Astonish You.It’s Printed On Gallery-grade Canvas And Professionally Wrapped Around A Wooden Frame,while Its Included Wall-mounting Hardware Saves You A Trip To The Store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ot4mAhuPL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lureu","source_asin":"B081L5M6NM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081L5M6NM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081L5M6NM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":219457,"name":"ORNISA Full Size White Sheet Set 100% Cotton 4 Piece Cool Crisp Percale Weave Embroidered Sheets Luxury Hotel Bedsheet, Oeko Tex Certified 16\" Deep Po","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":72.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q35q7-N+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LUXURIOUS 100% COTTON PERCALE WEAVE HOTEL SHEETS: ORNISA aims to provide the most decadent hotel bedding. This 100% COTTON PERCALE WEAVE SHEET SET will give you the 5 star hotel indulgence and will take you to your coziest memories of staying in a LUXURY HOTEL right at your home. This Hotel Luxury sheet contains 1 Flat Sheet (84 x 96 Inches) , 1 Fitted Sheet (54 x 76 + 16 Inches) and 2 Pillow cases (21 x 32 Inches). WE ARE VERY PICKY! HOPE YOU ARE TOO- We choose cotton with atmost care and quality control from best cotton farms in India. Cotton is processed into threads and subsequently into our sheets at our WORLD CLASS OEKO TEX certified plant. We have a triple check process to ensure that every set purchased by our esteemed customers is nothing but a gateway to a world class luxury hotel bedding experience. THE DNA OF ORNISA SHEET SET- ORNISA Sheets are 100% COTTON woven with a PERCALE WEAVE. Percale is a 1 under-1 over weave, which makes the sheet cool, crisp and a boon for hot sleepers. Percale weave also makes this sheet moisture wicking. This sheet being crisp may initially wrinkle more but will become softer with every subsequent wash and voila you will fall in love with it in no time! The Fitted sheet has 10mm elastic all around to give the perfect fit on the mattress with up to 16 inch deep. IS IT A HOTEL OR IS IT YOUR HOME- The pitfall of this sheet is that you may forget that you are at your home while you are sleeping. You may start believing you are in a 5 star hotel. So we wanted to warn you in advance. Cool and crisp Percale bed sheets, crafted in India from 100% premium, certified long-staple cotton is perfect for hot sleepers. Light weighted and durable Bed sheets will make you feel like snuggling up in luxury every single night. EMBROIDERED SHEET SETS- ORNISA sheets are a work of art. We have ALMA, ALTOMONTE, ATRANI AND ORTA design collections which will enthral you by their looks. Be it- Thanksgiving, Christmas, Birthdays or Anniversaries- your loved ones will absolutely adore this gift. Still waiting to buy one ? Oh come on - its sugar spice and everything nice! We aim for quality and customer satisfaction. We would love to hear your feedback! Have a Luxury Sleeping Experience! EASY MAINTENANCE- Machine Wash in warm water or get it professionally laundered. Delicate cycle with Whites and Light Colours Only. Do not Bleach. Cotton Percale Sheet will naturally wrinkle, but with every wash and continued use, your sheets will become softer and smoother. If you prefer to use a dryer, we recommend taking your sheets out of the dryer when damp and laying them flat to dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q35q7-N+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORNISA","source_asin":"B0C24R4G1W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219457","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C24R4G1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C24R4G1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
