window.products.push({"id":219517,"name":"XL Series Folding Card Table and Chair Set (5pc) - Ultra-Padded Chairs for All-Day Comfort - Fold Away Design, Quick Storage and Portability - Vinyl U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":359.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41r4chAOYXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Practical Convenience Meets All-Day Comfort! Whether you’re putting together a puzzle or catching up on old times, the hours fly when you’re with friends and family. But if you’re sitting on cold, hard metal chairs, it can quickly cause back pain and leg discomfort. Treat your guests to a bit of luxury with the XL Series Folding Card Table and Chair Set! This 5-piece collection features 4 of our 2” cushioned chairs. The thick, high density foam is as soft as it is comfortable, offering lumbar support and promoting good posture. With triple cross-bracing, quad leg hinging and ANSI/BIFMA certification, each one can hold up to 300lbs. Paired with our extra-large card table, you’re in for an afternoon of fun! Measuring 38x38,” you have plenty of room for food, games and more. ADA compliant and wheelchair accessible, it’s a must-have for senior centers and retirement communities. When the night’s over, the fold away design makes our set easy to use and even easier to store. Great for both indoor and outdoor use, these table and chairs are finished with a durable powder coat! It makes them resistant to scuffs and wear, and because they feature vinyl upholstery, they wipe clean with just a damp cloth. Why Choose Our XL Table and Chair Set? - Includes 4 ultra-padded chairs - Extra-large card table - Easy to set up and store - Safe for indoor or outdoor use - Strong, durable construction Try Today Risk Free with Our Money Back Guarantee! *Supply is limited. Order today to ensure availability. Order Your Folding Table Set Now for Comfort and Convenience!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41r4chAOYXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XL Series","source_asin":"B08V437WZ1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V437WZ1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V437WZ1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
