window.products.push({"id":219581,"name":"GUTZ Handcrafted Wicker Set of 3 Storage Handwoven Rattan Footlocker Basket Chest Home Organizers with Lids, Handles, Cloth Liner and Coconut Buttons,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":164.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91odS7oTNYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Handcrafted wicker basket set of 3 trunk chests is woven by artisans from eco-friendly and sustainable rattan that grow in nature under the warm tropical weather of the Philippine islands. Footlockers are made by a community of master weavers who have passed down the art of their craft for two or more generations. Each piece is unique and reflects the signature personal style of the artist who made the home accent by hand. The design has a relaxed charm and is decorative with its obvious handmade appearance, espresso mahogany stain, and the Live-Love-Laugh decor of the cloth liner with its coconut shell buttons, jute and raffia accents from nature. It works well with rustic country, farmhouse, green eco-friendly, sustainable nature, vintage, and beach cottage decorating style. The stitched border is simple and clean so it can fit a minimalist design as well. The handwoven storage bins have carrying handles, lid covers, cloth liners and come in 3 sizes: Small (22”L x 12\"W x 13\"H), Medium (24\"L x 14\"W x 15\"H), Large (26\"L x 16\"W x 17\"H). They are stackable, nesting and provide a practical and convenient decorating storage solution so you can organize clutter and keep any room stylish and clean. Use the set to stow office supplies and paper files, arts and crafts, magazines, books, kids’ and pets’ toys, CDs and other media, electronics, shoes, clothes, bedroom blankets and linens, curtains, kitchen table cloths, bath towels, and many more household or office items. Give as gift to family, friends, or as a decorative housewarming present to store keepsakes and treasures, family heirlooms, memories like photos or framed pictures, travel souvenirs, and much more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91odS7oTNYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GUTZ","source_asin":"B081BC1THH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219581","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081BC1THH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081BC1THH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
