window.products.push({"id":219596,"name":"Memory Foam Bath Mat Set Bathroom Mat Set Ultra Soft 3 Piece Bathroom Rug Non Slip and Highly Water Absorbent Bathroom Floor Mat Machine Washable Toil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712fNTBXgLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💧【HIGHLY WATER-ABSORBENT & QUICK DRYING】The microfiber fabric on the surface of bath mat is very fine and soft, it absorbs moisture quickly and absorbs 10 times more water than itself. In addition, the inner material has pores that allow air to pass through easily, making the bath mat dry very quickly. 💗【3-LAYER STRUCTURE FOR MAXIMUM COMFORT】The bath mat is made of super soft and fluffy microfiber, memory foam, and non-slip PVC backing. Super soft and comfortable to the touch, the low-resilience foam gently absorbs body pressure, giving you a smooth, clean and comfortable fit. In addition, this bathroom mat comes with a high foam density, so it won't feel sticky even when you step on it, and you won't feel cold in winter. 👣【NON-SLIP & DURABLE】The back of the bath mat set is made of non-slip PVC resin for a firm grip. it won't shift or slide, keep you safe and cozy. everyone from children to the elderly can use it safely and securely. Moreover, the high-quality PVC backing prevents water from seeping to soft surface. make the bath rug staying dry and comfortable. our bathroom mats are much stronger and durable for long-time use. 🛀【PERFECT BATH MAT SET WITH MULTI-PURPOSE】The 3 piece bathroom mat set size: 17” X 24”+24” X 24”+24” X 32”, Comes with 1 U-shape toilet mat. With an easy-to-use design, the bath rug set are widely used in various occasions. the smart choice for your home, bathroom, restroom, entryway and others. 🚿【MACHINE WASH & DRY】: The bristles of the bath mat are very short, so it does not collect dust, does not trap hair, and does not easily get tangled with dirt such as dust. The 3 piece bathroom rug set are very easy to clean., hand wash and machine wash OK. It will not shed hair, fade and fall apart after many years washes and dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712fNTBXgLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOUYOMICS","source_asin":"B0BFRD624C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219596","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFRD624C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFRD624C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
