window.products.push({"id":219608,"name":"Scott Living Hygro Cotton Sheets for Full Size Bed 400TC - 4 Piece | 1 Flat Sheet - 1 Fitted Sheet - 2 Pillowcases | Cooler in Summer & Warmer in Wint","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I6W0MOIGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"After renovating houses for hundreds of families, hosts of HGTV’s “Property Brothers” Drew and Jonathan Scott know how to make a home work for everyone – and that includes high-quality home furnishings, textiles and décor that look great and fit your needs. Scott Living by Drew & Jonathan reflects their commitment to help you create the perfect space for the people you love. With the Scott Brothers’ latest collection featuring modern and nature-inspired patterns, you’re sure to make a statement. A DESIGNER LOOK TO LOVE in a 100% cotton sheet set. Features a lustrous-sateen weave, in a range of solid colors of blue, gray, taupe, white, yellow or brown. Crafted in a recycled 400 thread-count luxury fabric with durability that gets softer over time. Sustainably sourced with HygroCotton hollow core yarn technology that provides breathable, moisture wicking performance properties to regulate temperature, keeping you warm in the winter and cooler in the summer for natural comfort. MUST HAVE FEATURES Our modern soft sheets are constructed for everyday performance. Both flat sheet & pillowcase feature a 4\"cuff with single pleat for a tailored look. Decorative stitch and silk like smoothness for luxury. Fitted sheet includes an elastic band for a snug fit and fits a mattress up to 16” deep. Cover up with the right amount of warmth and breathability for a blissful sleep. Full Set includes: 1 flat sheet (81\"x96\"), 1 fitted sheet (54\"x76\"x16\"), 2 standard pillowcases (20\"x30\"). CAREFULLY DESIGNED, Scott Living bedding is better for you, your family, and the planet. Our products are Oeko-Tex Made in Green Certified. They have met high environmental safety standards and are tested for harmful substances. Our sustainable products are manufactured under environmentally friendly and socially responsible working conditions. Our cotton sheet set is environmentally friendly as cotton fibers are naturally biodegradable unlike microfiber that is difficult to break down. EASY CARE, Machine wash warm with like colors, gentle cycle. Only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry low, remove promptly. Warm iron when needed. We stand by our product and offer a 30-DAY \"LOVE-IT\" GUARANTEE, \"We're not happy unless you're happy\". We recommend for an added polished look, pair or gift with the Baristo Quilt Set, the Charles Faux Fur Blanket and many other elegant options by Scott Living that add designer luxury to the bedroom and home. Each sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I6W0MOIGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scott Living","source_asin":"B09NL1KP5Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NL1KP5Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NL1KP5Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
