window.products.push({"id":219613,"name":"ZINUS 14 Inch Green Tea Cooling Gel Memory Foam Hybrid Mattress / Pocket Innersprings for Motion Isolation / Edge Support, Queen, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":484.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s3H3ILgIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The soft memory foam and revolutionary independent pocket springs of our Green Tea Cooling Swirl Memory Foam Hybrid Mattress are just what you need to inspire restorative sleep. Equipped with all the bells and whistles you could want in a mattress, it begins with layers of top quality CertiPUR-US certified comfort and Cooling Swirl memory foams, which ensure that your body is not only perfectly contoured, but also perfectly cool throughout the night. Thermoregulating gel helps draw heat away from the body, keeping your temperature in the ideal zone for sound and peaceful sleep. And that’s not all. A base layer of supportive pocket innersprings ensures durability as well as motion isolation, meaning you remain undisturbed even if your partner or pets have more ‘active’ sleep habits. And for those that do like to move around at night, this mattress has you covered with its superior foam edge support, designed to make sitting on and staying in bed that much easier. We could go on and on about everything from its premium quilted cover with convenient handles to its included 10 year worry-free warranty, but instead, let’s just say that this one’s got everything you need to put your sleep woes to bed once and for all.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81s3H3ILgIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zinus","source_asin":"B073ZVM5X5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073ZVM5X5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073ZVM5X5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
