window.products.push({"id":219653,"name":"HOMQUEN Iced Tea Spoon with Straw Handle for Drinking, 4 Pieces 8.7\" Stainless Steel Long Handle Bar Spoon Silverware for Mixing and Stirring (4 Packs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WlomQC23L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"These Iced Tea Spoon length is 8.7 '', It is perfect for bar, cocktail, ice cream, drinking, iced tea, mixing, strirring Suitable for Bar, Home, Party use, Ideal for Mixing Drinks Like Lemonade Iced Tea, Ice Coffee, Milkshakes, Root Beer Floats and Enjoying Sundaes, Bartending Essential Tool; You can carry it with you and use it, which is environmentally friendly and convenient; for example, when you are traveling, gathering, car, office, barbecue, home, etc.; You can enjoy your eco-friendly life with environmentally friendly Spoons; Strong and Sturdy：Made of 304 Stainless Steel, Mirror Polish and Gold Titanium Plated,Rust proof, High hardness, Lead-free, Cadmium-free, Phthalate-free and Eco-Friendly, Safe and healthy for daily use. Sturdy, Convenient, and Dishwasher Safe；","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WlomQC23L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMQUEN","source_asin":"B08CRRZY1P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219653","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CRRZY1P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CRRZY1P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":219654,"name":"3 Pack Push Down Bottle Cap Opener by HQY, Silver (New Version)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V-VFMbjYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"◆HQY Automatic Beer Bottle Opener, Silver ◆Checkout some of the amazing features of the Bottle Opener: ◆-Super-fast, Easy to Use and Portable ◆-Better than wall mounted bottle opener ◆-Opens Beer and Soda Glass Bottles Instantly ◆-Cap Catcher within the Bottle Opener ◆-High-Quality and Durable ◆-Great for Cap Collectors ◆-Won't Bend Caps. Cap can be re-used to Save Beer for later ◆-Great for Men, Women or Seniors who have arthritis ◆-Used by professional Bartenders ◆-Perfect Dad Gifts - Great for BBQ, parties, sporting events, super-bowls, Great for men, women and Seniors, Best stocking stuffers for men or women, perfect gifts for dads or best-man, or give the coolest housewarming gifts. ◆Open bottles in seconds with this! I do not drink a lot, but I have a beer or hard iced tea now and then. Even with twist off tops, I have to find a towel or use my shirt to open bottles. It takes me a few minutes and my hands get cut up sometimes.  This is the best invention ever. My husband loves it too! It is so easy! Just put the on your bottle and press down. Lift it up and it pulls the top off your bottle. There is an item in the top, which is what pulls the bottle cap off. It is small and fits perfectly in a wet bar, cupboard, or even your purse if you plan to take it out with you. ◆Love this popper! I got one from a convention and my kids absolutely thought it was the greatest thing. So I purchased one for each of them and they were so excited. It works so slick and even on twist off caps too, its great to have and I use mine all the time. ◆Loveeee! Great product! Very durable! I bought one for my house and then had to buy one for all of our family members!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V-VFMbjYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HQY","source_asin":"B013P9WN6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219654","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013P9WN6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013P9WN6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":219655,"name":"Sunbeam Heated Throw Lagoon Blue 50\"x60\" 3 Heat Settings Auto Off On NEW","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8169ig4aPtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cozy and ultra soft Velvet plush electric heated throw.Curl up and relax in head-to-toe warmth with the Sunbeam Electric Heated Throw Blanket. Crafted from luxuriously soft velvet plush fabric, this heated blanket offers the warmth and softness you need to fend off winter chills. This heated blanket features three heat settings and an easy-to-use controller, it delivers consistent heat that you can adjust to your preferences. Its thermofine wiring system uses thin, flexible wires that help ensure superior heat distribution while remaining virtually undetectable. This heated blanket features a convenient 3-hour auto shutoff that provides peace of mind. Measuring 50 by 60 inches, this self-heating plush blanket is large enough to use as a personal throw or wrap. It's also machine washable and dryer safe, which makes it easy to clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8169ig4aPtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunbeam","source_asin":"B00N9QTUHG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N9QTUHG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N9QTUHG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
