window.products.push({"id":219791,"name":"Personalized Gymnast Ornament 2022 – Polyresin Girls Gymnastics Ornament – Gymnast Girl on Beam Brown Décor – Gymnastics Christmas Ornaments – Gymnast","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e6-BljPQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Polyresin Gymnastics Christmas Ornament – Unlike other Holiday decor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our gymnastics ornament is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors and festive details of a girl displaying her talent for gymnastics. This Holiday, add some Olympics style to your decor and show off the sport you loved the most with this gymnast ornament! Expert Artist Personalization – Unlike other personalized sports ornaments for Christmas tree that often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. Every sports fan ornament is delicately hand painted to ensure its unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND miniature personalized gymnastic ornament you’ll always cherish. Celebrate Life’s Biggest Moments – and your favorite pastime! Commemorate your family’s favorite activity with these special sports Christmas ornaments honoring the pastime you enjoy together every year! Your whimsical gymnastics ornament for girls and gymnastics coach ornament will make the family tree feel extra special and unique to your home. The ultimate present to the gymnasts in your life, your favorite athlete, or any little girl who's dreamed of becoming a gymnast! 24-Hour Order Processing – Our gymnast Christmas decorations make beautiful gymnast gifts for girls, gymnastic coach gifts and gymnast gifts for teens to cherish every Holiday season. Your gymnast figurine will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a Gift Box, Gift Bag and Gift Tag – no need for wrapping! Free custom personalization included with your personalized gymnastics ornament. Great gifts for gymnastics enthusiasts, coach or fans! Happy Sports Lovers – At Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting beautiful gymnastic decorations for party and sports decorations for families to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 tree ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship. If for any reason you don’t love your gymnastics figurine 2022, please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e6-BljPQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B08TMRM36Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219791","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TMRM36Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TMRM36Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
