window.products.push({"id":219823,"name":"ThermoProb Instant Read Thermometer, Super-Fast Digital Cooking Tool for all Kinds of Food, Meat, Grill, BBQ, Preserves and Baking - Includes Meat Tem","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-bqNcF7DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The newly designed ThermoProb instant read thermometer is a very useful tool to have in your kitchen. Whether you are a professional or a home cook, whether you are cooking, baking, preserving or simply barbecuing, ThermoProb will give you fast and accurate temperature reading of your food all the time. Designed for Convenience ThermoProb is designed for fast and accurate readings on all food temperatures. Its reduced tip probe cuts down drastically on the response time giving quick and accurate temperature measurements for all types of food. The 110 mm long stainless steel probe allows safe use while testing the temperatures. It can probe deep within a stuffed turkey or a whole chicken to give an accurate reading without the fear of burning your hand. The probe folds onto the handle for safe and compact storage and is small and safe enough to be slipped into a pocket without the fear of being poked. It is splash proof to a high standard conforming to IPX4. The ABS plastic casing is designed for comfortable grip. The digital LED display with backlight is easy to read even in low light conditions. Wide Temperature Range The operating range of the thermometer is quite wide, it is effective from : -50 to +300°C (-58 to 572 °F) which is ideal for ice-creams, desserts, whole roasts, cake, cookies, jams, preserves, etc. °F/°C Selectable Push the °F/°C button located inside the battery conpartment to select the desired temperature unit Specifications ♦ Response time: 4-7 seconds  ♦ Accuracy: ±1°C  ♦ Range: -50 to +300°C (-58 to 572 °F)  ♦ Battery type: 1 x 3V CR2032 lithium coin cell  ♦ Battery life: 3500 + hours  ♦ Auto-off: 10 mins  ♦ Display size: 35 x 14mm  ♦ Probe size: 3 x 110mm You are backed by our lifetime warranty! Be sure to Order yours now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-bqNcF7DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ThermoProb","source_asin":"B01N4N0SJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N4N0SJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N4N0SJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
