window.products.push({"id":219843,"name":"MYSKY HOME 54 Inch Long Kitchen Curtains Burnt Orange Blackout Curtains for Bedroom Small Windows Grommet Thermal Insulated Curtains for Nursery Short","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mYM0lj0ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WELL MADE: 2 panels Orange short curtains per package. 1.6-inch inner diameter grommets fit easily with standard curtain rods. Each panel is W52 x L54, total size is W104 x L54. AMAZING MATERIAL: Super heavy and soft Blackout Drape Panels are very upmarket. No coating, no formaldehyde, Fade-resistant, skin-friendly, privacy protection, creates a harmonious environment. The same materials are on both sides. UNIQUE DESIGN: Kitchen curtain makes a great view while providing a bit of privacy. The grommet top adds a modern touch to home decor. Curtain panels provide a more harmonious window dressing, just like a custom-made one. EXTENSIVE USE: Match different styles of blackout curtains with the same color in the MYSKY HOME store. Besides, various style valances are available. Perfect choice for bathroom, kitchen, cafe store or any small window. EASY CARE: Good quality finishing will withstand years of use. Machine washable and Wash the water temperature below 86F. Mild detergent no bleaching. Low-temperature ironing. Don’t use sharp things scratching curtains.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mYM0lj0ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MYSKY HOME","source_asin":"B0BKLNQSZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKLNQSZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKLNQSZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":219844,"name":"KUAYIXIA Heated Blanket Electric Throw Twin Full, Soft Flannel to Sherpa Reversible Fast Warming Heating Throw, Washable Heater Electric Blankets 50in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HCN4Q38eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Advanced Heating Technology: The built-in heating wire of 50\"x 60\" twin heated blanket employs advanced processing to provide you with super comfort and warmth on chilly days. Concealed evenly distributed heating wires are laid in U-shape, which heat up faster, allowing you to reach a comfortable state in a very short time. The exquisite elegant appearance is very suitable for the layout of your room. Smart Controller Design: Please disburden to use electric blankets certified by ETL and FCC. The electric blanket matches with a controller which has 10 heat settings (96°F-122°F) to make the heating blanket easy and practical to use, satisfying individual needs. 3 gear set timer(2/4/8 hours)-Heated throw is specially designed with an over-heating protection function. When the set time is up, it will automatically stop heating to avoid accidents and save energy, letting you sleep well. Superior Soft Fabric: Twin electric blanket is double-sided, one side is silky 330GSM flannel, and the other side is high-quality 220GSM Sherpa lining, both sides work efficiently to preserve heat for further warmth. Soft heated blanket is thick enough to bring an optimal sense of comfort, skin-friendly experience and offer you excellent warmth. Combine this comfort with heating capabilities and our electric blankets will become a perfect partner in the cold winter. Various Functions: The heating blanket is equipped with a 7-foot long power cord, which is flexible to use. Electric blankets not only keep you warm no matter how cold the weather is, but also help relax muscles and joints throughout the body, and relieve fatigue after work and exercise. Suitable for use on the couch, sofa, bed, or to wrap up while watching tv, reading a book, or office. Just simply remove the controller, it can also be used as a normal blanket for all-year use. Machine Washable & 100% Satisfaction: Before wash, please take off the heating controller and power cables. Clean this electric throw blanket by hand or machine according to the guide on User Manual. Machine wash under 40°C/104°F to keep its best condition. If you have any questions about the electric heated blanket, please do not hesitate to contact us. We will spare our effort to solve it for you as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HCN4Q38eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KUAYIXIA","source_asin":"B09N14JZMR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219844","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N14JZMR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N14JZMR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
