window.products.push({"id":219911,"name":"Skenda Salt And Pepper Mill Grinder Set with 2 Adjustable Stainless Steel Mill Grinder - Free E-books (5) with this set - Ceramic Mill Mechanism - Man","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j9ajDpnbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There's a reason why the waiter brings the pepper mill to your table before you enjoy a meal! Fresh seasonings ground at the table with a salt grinder or pepper grinder taste so much better than the ones that have been pre-ground and sitting in salt and pepper shakers for weeks or months! If you want to enjoy that straight-from-the salt & pepper mill taste at home, our Salt And Pepper Shaker Grinder Set is the perfect solution Skenda gives you a pair of salt and pepper grinders that are ideal for Himalayan salt, sea salt, black peppercorns and even whole spices like nutmeg You get a pepper shaker and a salt shaker with a built-in grinder with our salt and pepper grinder set, so you can enjoy fresh seasonings at the table and grind salt and pepper fresh when you're cooking Our salt & pepper shakers are the best salt & pepper grinder set on Amazon because they're EASIER TO USE . Our ceramic salt & pepper grinder mechanism is highly effective and works as you twist the shaker. Salt or pepper is then dispensed automatically for maximum convenience ADJUSTABLE. With this salt & pepper mill set, you can choose a fine or coarse grind to suit whatever you're savoring. BETTER QUALITY . We make our salt and pepper shaker set to restaurant quality standards out of rust-proof, food safe stainless steel. MORE STYLISH. You'll love the way our salt and pepper shakers look on your dinner table. They add elegance to every meal. SIMPLER TO FILL. Our pepper mill and salt grinder feature clear windows that let you see how much seasoning is left inside. You can have the salt & pepper shakers refilled in just seconds. See how much more flavorful your favorite foods can be when you season them with freshly ground seasonings dispensed from your own salt & pepper set. Order with confidence the Skenda Salt and Pepper Grinder today Life time warranty!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j9ajDpnbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SKENDA","source_asin":"B01LK6VZDS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219911","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LK6VZDS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LK6VZDS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
