window.products.push({"id":219921,"name":"Yogibo Roll Body Pillow, Multi-Purpose for Side Sleeping, Pregnancy, Sitting, Filled with Soft Micro-Beads for Adults and Kids, Turquoise","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":98.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BlZGJYZbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LARGE, VERSATILE TOTAL BODY PILLOW: This will be the best body pillow in your home! It will be a hit in your kid’s bedrooms, playroom, basement, or family room. It’s lightweight and portable, so you can take the firm body pillow from room to room. Measures 66 x 10 x 10 Inches MAKES THE BEST MATERNITY BODY PILLOW: The right pregnancy body pillow will keep you comfy and help ease some aches and pains. This is the best body pillow for pregnant women due to the support it provides for women lying on their side. MICRO-BEADS ARE THE IDEAL FIRMNESS: Zero pressure points ensure fidget-free relaxation. The inside of this body pillow is filled with special micro-beads that automatically adjust to the shape of your body and will keep you cool and comfy while you relax. SUPER SOFT, WASHABLE OUTER COVER: The outer cover is made from a cotton and spandex blend. The body pillow cover with zipper is easy to remove and can be machine washed with similar colors when it needs a little freshening. Comfort and convenience, all-in-one. CREATE A PORTABLE YOGIBO COUCH: Combine the Yogibo Roll Pillow with Yogibo Max to create the comfiest little love seat. This nifty portable sofa will be able to hold up to 4 people while taking up only 4 feet of space! It comes in handy when you’re entertaining.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BlZGJYZbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yogibo","source_asin":"B07CPQDB1Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219921","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CPQDB1Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CPQDB1Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":219922,"name":"Melange 6-Piece 100% Melamine 8.5\" Salad Plates (Clay Collection) | Shatter-Proof and Chip-Resistant Melamine Salad Plates | Color - Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qoHY0cO7L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"Experience the Difference of an Authentic Melamine Dinner Set Upgrade your dinnerware set with one that blends superior durability, hassle-free maintenance, and rustic charm. Made using heavy weight melamine, these dinner plate and bowls are virtually unbreakable, keeps chips and cracks at bay, and can actually be cleaned in the dishwasher. Introduce some quirk to your dinner table with a beautiful melamine dinnerware set that doesn’t cut corners. - Heavy duty feel and break-resistant design. - Comes in multiple pack options at a price you’ll love. - Assorted colors - Dishwasher safe and 100% BPA-free. - Great for camping, RVs and outdoor use. Extra Dose of Durability Not all melamine dinner sets are created equal. Most come with a melamine content of between 30-60% that makes them weak, prone to cracks, and easy to shatter. But we’ve taken the premium approach and used higher percentage of melamine to create dinner plates and bowls that beautifully weather the rigors of everyday use Great for Outdoors No need for paper plates. Whether you’re going out camping, having an outdoor soiree, or setting off in your RV or trailer, our melamine plates and bowls complement it all with a touch of durability. Tough and hardy, this dinnerware set introduces a sense of normalcy to outdoor dining without any of the fragility. Maintenance Made Easy Get yourself melamine plates and bowls that you can actually clean in the dishwasher. While others break or crack while placed in there, our fully melamine dinner set can be safely cleaned without chipping the plates or ruining the design. Dine in Style Quirky yet cute, vintage yet modern, this colorful melamine dinnerware infuses any setting with a charm that never quits. The plates and bowls come in multiple colors and design options and are crowned by beautiful asymmetry. About Melange Melange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That’s why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qoHY0cO7L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B074WGTW2P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219922","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074WGTW2P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074WGTW2P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
