window.products.push({"id":219978,"name":"Chico Creek Signs Farm Fresh Eggs Sign Vintage Sweet Farmhouse Signs Decor Chicken Coop Decorations Barnyard Egg for Sale Hen House Rustic Accessories","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51o7xMYRxiL._AC_.jpg","description":"Premium Grade Sign - Made of .040\" aluminum (60% thicker than other .025\" aluminum and tin signs), this 8 inch by 12 inch sign is made in the USA with American made materials and American craftsmanship. It consists of an image baked into a LOW LUSTER powder coating over a thick heavy gauge aluminum. The image has the appearance of an aged and weathered sign with simulated rusted edges and scratched and faded paint on a low luster powder coated finish. It has smooth rounded corners and includes mounting holes. Each sign is made to order and individually handcrafted. You will find reproductions, vintage looking original designs, clean, new looking signs without the rust and scratches, and many personalized designs. Our signs make great gifts and they are also perfect for your home, office, business, garage, man cave, she shed, dorm room, game room, kitchen or any place you'd like to display this unique sign. We have several thousand different designs available with more being added every day. Personalization :We offer many styles of personalized signs, many that can be customized with names or important dates. The price of this sign includes FREE SHIPPING which usually takes 3 to 5 days in the United States. Premium Grade -  Made out of .040\" thick aluminum (60% thicker than .025\" aluminum or tin signs) with a wonderful low luster powder coated finish for a great look and feel! or Premium Grade -  Made out of .040\" thick aluminum (60% thicker than .025\" aluminum or tin signs) with a wonderful low luster powder coated finish for a great look and feel! or Durable aluminum won't rust, 8 inches x 12 inches w/ rounded corners and mounting holes Durable aluminum won't rust, 8 inches x 12 inches w/ rounded corners and mounting holes Made and shipped in the USA. Don't be fooled by cheap counterfeit signs from overseas. This is American Made! Made and shipped in the USA. Don't be fooled by cheap counterfeit signs from overseas. This is American Made! Usually SHIPS IN 1 to 2 DAYS. RECEIVE IT in 4-5 DAYS from a USA Mfr. Usually SHIPS IN 1 to 2 DAYS. RECEIVE IT in 4-5 DAYS from a USA Mfr.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51o7xMYRxiL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chico Creek Signs","source_asin":"B07JMRLVML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219978","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JMRLVML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JMRLVML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":219979,"name":"All-Clad 7202 MC2 Professional Master Chef 2 Stainless Steel Bi-Ply Bonded Oven Safe PFOA Free Saucepan with Lid Cookware, 2-Quart, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516dbzI3HkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Preparing gravies and sauces is a breeze with the All-Clad MC2 2-Quart sauce pan. Designed with a classical sloped shape, the pan is unsurpassed in aesthetics and in quality. Attractively designed and incredibly tough, this piece is constructed of three layers of metal; a brushed aluminum alloy beautifully complements the polished, 18/10 stainless steel interior that provides the ideal cooking surface that can even withstand tough use of metal utensils. The long, stay-cool handle is riveted to the side of the pan for extra strength and durability, and helps prevent burns. Amazon.com The second generation of All-Clad's Master Chef line (MC2), this cookware combines brushed aluminum with stainless-steel accents for a contemporary look. Like All-Clad's other renowned cookware collections, Master Chef provides serious and professional cooks with all the virtues that make All-Clad's worldwide reputation unsurpassed. Key to its high performance is a three-ply, bonded construction. Sandwiched between the exterior and an 18/10 stainless-steel interior is a thick aluminum core that spreads heat evenly across the bottom of the pan and all the way up its sides. The interior is highly polished so it's stick- as well as corrosion-resistant. Handles, rivets, and tight-fitting lids are all gleaming stainless steel. This classic, straight-sided, 2-quart saucepan illustrates the Master Chef line's stylish yet practical design. Because the aluminum core extends up the sides, foods cook uniformly in the pan, even though it's 4-1/4 inches deep. And because the interior is nonreactive, tomato-based sauces and other acidic foods won't taste metallic. The pan's polished 18/10 stainless-steel pan and lid handles are riveted for strength and grooved on the top for comfort. The long handle (holed for hanging on a hook or peg) stays cool on the stovetop but won't be harmed by an oven's heat. Master Chef cookware carries a lifetime warranty against defects and should be hand washed. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516dbzI3HkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All-Clad","source_asin":"B00WJYXRYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-219979","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WJYXRYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WJYXRYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
